<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>MAINLY FOR CAMMY </Major>
    <Description>SHOULD WORK WITH OTHER CHAR WHOSE DP START WITH Kick. when you are in left side of screen
TRY CHANGING 4 TO UR DP BUTTON WHILE CUSTOMIZING.
KEEP THE MACRO PRESSED, JUST TAPPING WONT WORK</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 22 1
Delay 20 ms
KeyDown 7 1
Delay 20 ms
KeyUp 7 1
Delay 20 ms
KeyDown 7 1
Delay 20 ms
KeyDown 92 1
Delay 68 ms
KeyUp 92 1
